+      "title": "DRAFT: exact 1D Ising control for coupling normalization",
+      "statement": "DRAFT, independent mathematical review pending. For the 1D nearest-neighbor zero-field ferromagnetic Ising chain with beta>0, a=exp(2 beta), t=tanh beta, chi=a and xi=-1/log t. The fourth cumulant density is a-3a^3, so g_+=(3a-1/a)/xi>0 and tends to 6 as beta->infinity. In periodic N-site boxes the variance-normalized fourth deficit B_N tends to zero at every fixed beta, while B_N N/xi tends to this positive coupling.",
